id: violent-punishment
name: Violent Punishment
advancement: true
prerequisite: Force or Magic Score of 8+
tpCost: 10
# "If you use an Attacking Maneuver through the effects of Punisher Guard, apply an Energy Charge to that Attacking
# Maneuver" - granted with its Basic Attack.
punishCharge: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Punisher Guard's Basic Attack with an Energy Charge.
text: >
  Violent Punishment: The brutal force of your counterattack leaves your enemies reeling.
  –Prerequisites: Force or Magic Score of 8+
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: If you use an Attacking Maneuver through the effects of Punisher Guard, apply an Energy Charge to that
  Attacking Maneuver.
